{
  "name": "WF6 Chatfuel DM",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### WF6 — Chatfuel DM reply\nChatfuel's comment automation fires this webhook with the inbound event:\n\n```json\n{ \"surface\": \"facebook\", \"conversation_id\": \"…\", \"text\": \"…\" }\n```\n\n1. **Normalise** — trim, lower-case the surface, refuse anything that is not\n   facebook, instagram or tiktok (YouTube has no DM channel in Chatfuel at all).\n2. **POST /api/chatfuel/dm** — the token stays in the app.\n3. **Wrong?** — Telegram. A DM that silently did not send is a member who asked a\n   question and never heard back.\n\nChatfuel answers **200 with `status: Failed` and a per-message `errors` array** for a\nDM it did not deliver, so the route refuses those (`CF04`, `CF05`) — this workflow\nonly has to read `ok`.\n\n**Requires:** `JARVIS_BRAIN_URL`, `CRON_SECRET`, `TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID`.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "c22823ce-2ae6-544a-8f86-5865d48eb889",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -380,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "chatfuel-dm",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "8ddd120f-aaf5-53ca-88e1-98282710acb9",
      "name": "Chatfuel fires",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const b = $json.body ?? $json;\nconst surface = String(b.surface || '').trim().toLowerCase();\nconst conversation_id = String(b.conversation_id || b.conversationId || '').trim();\nconst text = String(b.text || b.message || '').trim();\nconst allowed = ['facebook','instagram','tiktok'];\nconst why = !allowed.includes(surface) ? `surface ${surface || '(none)'} has no Chatfuel DM`\n  : !conversation_id ? 'no conversation_id — a DM is a reply, not a broadcast'\n  : !text ? 'empty text' : null;\nreturn [{ json: { valid: why === null, why, surface, conversation_id, text } }];"
      },
      "id": "3ac15624-5e23-5d05-9d28-d6b89f43d1c2",
      "name": "Normalise",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        230,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.valid }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "c5823235-c503-5c30-a556-84ec90210d89",
      "name": "Sendable?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        460,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $vars.JARVIS_BRAIN_URL }}/api/chatfuel/dm",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $vars.CRON_SECRET }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ surface: $json.surface, conversation_id: $json.conversation_id, text: $json.text }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000
        }
      },
      "id": "da4db81f-e0b1-5be5-904e-9b0bd05439cc",
      "name": "POST chatfuel/dm",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        690,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "592787f6-9d7a-5631-8d25-e277ba64e31b",
      "name": "Delivered?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        920,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $vars.TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID }}",
        "text": "=Chatfuel DM did not send.\nsurface: {{ $('Normalise').item.json.surface }}\nreason: {{ $json.error || 'unknown' }}\ndetail: {{ ($json.reason || '').toString().slice(0, 200) }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "a6ff38bb-d51a-5056-a000-bc9fd36cb373",
      "name": "DM failed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1150,
        -160
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_TELEGRAM",
          "name": "Jarvis Bot"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $vars.TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID }}",
        "text": "=Chatfuel event dropped: {{ $json.why }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "f9c20564-05b1-53a3-bd5a-db6a48387a23",
      "name": "Dropped",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        690,
        140
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_TELEGRAM",
          "name": "Jarvis Bot"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
